<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>PP_GUI_STATUS constants:
</p>
<ul><li>PP_GUI_STATUS_NO_USE = 0 (not visible on main GUI)</li>
<li>PP_GUI_STATUS_READ_ONLY = 1 (visible on main GUI, unusable)</li>
<li>PP_GUI_STATUS_USE = 2 (visible on main GUI, usable)</li></ul>
